👑🧠 Birbal and the Lazy Servant (Raw Story)

One day, Emperor Akbar noticed that one of his servants was very lazy.

The servant always tried to avoid work.

Akbar asked Birbal to teach him a lesson.

Birbal called the servant and said, “I have an easy job for you.”

The servant smiled.

Birbal gave him a long list of simple tasks.

“Finish these quickly,” Birbal said.

The servant thought it would be easy, but the list was very long.

He had to run here and there all day.

By evening, he was very tired.

Birbal said, “If you had worked properly every day, your work would not feel so hard.”

The servant realized his mistake.

💖 Moral:

Doing work regularly is easier than avoiding it.
